      "review_summary": "The PR adds a core doctor normalizer that rewrites `models.providers.google` by backfilling `api`, pruning legacy input modalities, and adding `cost.cacheWrite`.\n\nPR surface: Source +101. Total +101 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current config can carry the legacy Google block while the model registry rejects the generated catalog for missing API, unsupported inputs, and missing `cacheWrite`. I did not run a live credentialed Google repro in this read-only pass.",
